  "explanation": "The question asks what position Friedrich von Amerling currently or formerly held. From D1S2, it is clear that he was the court painter to the Austrian imperial family, a role he held historically. From D2S2 and D2S3, it is stated that he was elected to the European Parliament in 1875, making 'member of the European Parliament' a valid historical position. While D2S12 states he served on the Committee for Cultural and Educational Affairs, this is best described as a function within the Parliament rather than a standalone position. Therefore, the phrasing 'Served on the Committee...' is preferred over 'Committee for...' to avoid misrepresenting the nature of the role."
